"El comportamiento de B<putwchar>() depende de la categoría B<LC_CTYPE> de la "
"localización actual."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"It is reasonable to expect that B<putwchar>()  will actually write the "
"multibyte sequence corresponding to the wide character I<wc>."
msgstr ""
"Es razonable esperar que B<putwchar>() escriba realmente la secuencia "
"multibyte correspondiente al carácter ancho I<wc>."

